$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=ld2cs  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lean ` key ` of ` sq_integral_weight_le ` , the weighted AM-GM inequality with free real constants ` X ` , ` M ` : ` 2 X M S. W Z <_ X ^ 2 S. W + M ^ 2 S. W Z ^ 2 ` for nonnegative integrable ` W ` , ` Z ` (pointwise ` 0 <_ ( X - M Z ) ^ 2 ` ; ~ itgle , ~ itgadd , ~ itgmulc2 ).

